SUMMARY:Disturbing the Peace: Sonoma County's Early Punk Underground\, Exhibition Opening
DESCRIPTION:The Museum of Sonoma County is excited to present Disturbing the Peace: Sonoma County’s Early Punk Underground an immersive exhibition tracing the rise of a subculture that refused to play by the rules. \nFrom 5–7 p.m.\, step into the raw\, rebellious world of Sonoma County’s underground punk scene at the Museum to get a special first look at the exhibtion.
