SUMMARY:Pitbull Power Line Dance Party at the Vintage Space
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a high-energy night of music\, movement\, and full Pitbull energy at Vintage Space. \n  \nWe’re turning the dance floor into a global party with a DJ spinning all your favorite Pitbull hits and dance anthems. The night kicks off with line dancing lessons at 7:30 PM\, so whether you’re a total beginner or just need a refresher\, you’ll be ready to hit the floor.\nAfter the lesson\, it’s all about dancing all night long. Expect big beats\, crowd favorites\, and a room full of people ready to move.\nBald caps and suits are highly encouraged. Channel your inner Mr. Worldwide and commit to the vibe. \nBringing boots\, beats\, and community to Sonoma County\, Grapevine Dance was born when three friends saw a need for more social fun and took matters into their own hands. Partnering with local businesses\, they’ve created vibrant line dancing events where newcomers and seasoned dancers alike can kick up their heels\, connect\, and celebrate the joy of dance. What started as a hobby has grown into a thriving community\, so grab your boots and join the movement.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pitbull-power-line-dance-party-at-the-vintage-space/
LOCATION:Vintage Space at The Flamingo Resort\, 2777 Fourth St.\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
GEO:38.45182;-122.68916
