SUMMARY:Bohemian Highway with The Callie Watts Band
DESCRIPTION:An evening of rich harmonies and danceable Americana with Bohemian Highway\, plus original folk rock from the Callie Watts Band.\nSpend an evening with Bohemian Highway\, a six-piece band blending Americana\, folk rock\, and pop with rich harmonies and danceable melodies. Formed in 2010 and rooted in the spirit of West Sonoma County\, the group\, led by frontman Doug Blumer\, performs original songs inspired by nature\, love\, and the shared experiences that bring people together.\nOpening the night is the Callie Watts Band\, a newly assembled group of standout musicians supporting Callie’s original material. Together\, these two acts promise a warm\, lively night of heartfelt songwriting and engaging live performance. \nTickets $18 in advance\, $25 at the door. Doors open 6:30pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/bohemian-highway-with-the-callie-watts-band/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
