SUMMARY:Tokes & Jokes: Stand Up Comedy Night
DESCRIPTION:Turn up the laughs and light up the night! Join us at The Lounge at Mercy for another comedy sesh packed with killer punchlines\, chill vibes\, and clouds of good times—headlined by Josef Anolin. Josef takes the stage with irreverent stories pulled straight from real life and a uniquely offbeat perspective. An Oakland native now based in Los Angeles\, he’s opened for Tom Segura\, Whitney Cummings\, and Michael Che. \nPresented in partnership with Comedy IRL\, this smoke-filled standup session blends good buds\, great food\, and unfiltered laughter in the North Bay’s only cannabis social club. Arrive early to grab your seat\, grab a bite\, and let the good vibes roll before the show kicks off. \nSponsored By: ABX
